          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Chindaalo chilikho chiicha lukoba lucha khwombakhwa lundi khulwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Lukhombakhwe khukhwama khu ndeleelwa eya Hananeli mumbo khukhwola khu Silibwa sie mu koona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lulwakha lukhache lwole khu Lukulu lwa Karebu mumbo mala lukobole luche Koa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Litooma lioosi lie baafu ne likokhe ne kimikuunda kioosi khukhwola khu sinoko sia Kitironi khu koona eye silibwa sie Farasi ebukwe, bilaba bitakatifu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Se bilatechulwa namwe bionakwe lundi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
